~ start
Lost guy: Where is the library?
if not GLOBAL.important_words['where']
	- Those's letters sounds like 'Where'
	set Language.known_letters.merge({"w": true, "h": true, "e": true, "r": true}, true)
	set Language.level += 1
	set GLOBAL.important_words['where'] = true
	Lost guy: Where is the library?
if Language.level == 6
	- Up, in the city
	Lost guy: Thanks!
=> END